00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.870
especially the sports agency business,

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:36.130
what that business is and
maybe a little bit about

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.763
why you got interested
and how you got into it.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.583
- Well, it's awesome to be with you.

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:44.100
I remember our first time
I came to your office

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.810
I actually was just going
